Revision history for Term-Maze

0.01    Date/time
        First version, released on an unsuspecting world.

0.02    2025-08-10
	- Fix deps.

0.03 	2025-08-11
	- Adds aze.pm so you can do - perl -Maze=40,20 - Thanks to TOBYINK for suggesting this.

0.04 	2025-08-14
	- Add support for HJKL movement keys, Thanks James Wright for the suggestion.

0.05    2026-10-11
        - run takes --width, --height and --help as well as two integers, and returns the exit status
        - The terminal mode is restored on every way out
        - q and escape quit

0.06    2026-10-13
        - Add options, the fields a launcher offers before a game
